{
"file": 11,
"paths": [
"d002/f601"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "193592df",
"en_raw": "Ghost voice under Hirumi Stn west tracks?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "33fc6904",
"en_raw": "Again?..."
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "a54446a1",
"en_raw": "I've heard a mountain of"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "032ca1cb",
"en_raw": "rumors like that about that place"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "4efe36bd",
"en_raw": "Yeah, me too"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "76e815e2",
"en_raw": "But why"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "6c26eef9",
"en_raw": "is it always there?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "52f5b056",
"en_raw": "Dark, smelly, dirty..."
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "f6efdd74",
"en_raw": "Drunks around..."
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "e0f90357",
"en_raw": "Even weirder people around..."
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "7571435a",
"en_raw": "There are plenty of reasons"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "593a0349",
"en_raw": "you could name"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "c0a85bf2",
"en_raw": "Hmm, but is that all?"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "52a609f9",
"en_raw": "That place, I think"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "6104b086",
"en_raw": "had construction just last year, right?"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "5d8d0300",
"en_raw": "And yet it's already like that..."
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "0739d154",
"en_raw": "So what"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "cf59de8e",
"en_raw": "you're saying there's another reason?"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "e363c89a",
"en_raw": "I don't know, but..."
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "393f69ed",
"en_raw": "You're a weird one, you know"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "f4a352c7",
"en_raw": "You hate that kind of story"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "dfa10dc5",
"en_raw": "I was asked to, after all"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "1ea2e2cc",
"en_raw": "It gives a bad feeling... why?"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "2d5ac0fe",
"en_raw": "I wonder why"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "5b2b8409",
"en_raw": "I know"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "d28c1ce4",
"en_raw": "That overly friendly"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "e45e427a",
"en_raw": "basketball girl, right?"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "3a3d3574",
"en_raw": "Just ignore her"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "3737722f",
"en_raw": "Kurumi doesn't like it..."
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "ce082e7c",
"en_raw": "Hirumi Station, the side nearer the Tama River"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "a2013e06",
"en_raw": "the underpass, right?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "8849886a",
"en_raw": "If it's so scary"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "e1025cfb",
"en_raw": "don't go through it"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "88ac3730",
"en_raw": "Hey Sango, did you see the flowers?"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "4daef68a",
"en_raw": "I remembered"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "bd143793",
"en_raw": "I heard from Segawa the other day"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "87ffa099",
"en_raw": "that there was a traffic accident near the station"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "a6d235a9",
"en_raw": "and the scene was"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "768a1c87",
"en_raw": "that underpass, right?"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "82309cdc",
"en_raw": "...I'm sure of it"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "ebb45a68",
"en_raw": "Calm down, will you"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "a6e0a1fe",
"en_raw": "With a normal imagination"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "d8c161a1",
"en_raw": "you'd sense a bad atmosphere"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "bc32d76d",
"en_raw": "Especially if you'd heard"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "9724b5d3",
"en_raw": "about an incident there..."
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "4932df24",
"en_raw": "...So it's all in your head?"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "8e4b4b93",
"en_raw": "What else would it be?"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "5c0fa54e",
"en_raw": "You see, she wants to go home"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "db336c70",
"en_raw": "...Huh?"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "61d6d197",
"en_raw": "You want to go home, Shiina?"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "53f3d575",
"en_raw": "No, not me, a woman"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "059d1143",
"en_raw": "She wants to go home"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "d4f3de69",
"en_raw": "...Yes, yes, understood"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "2c3d03a6",
"en_raw": "Well, my shoulders are"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "3714892e",
"en_raw": "stiff today too"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "5305f3a2",
"en_raw": "Let's call the underpass done for today"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "15423a4d",
"en_raw": "You see, the woman"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "d3704ff9",
"en_raw": "wants to go home..."
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "8f31c9e9",
"en_raw": "We've heard that many times"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "6b568b53",
"en_raw": "What are you talking about?"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "d32cda92",
"en_raw": "Dammit!"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "ab599b9e",
"en_raw": "The more I remember"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "270442ab",
"en_raw": "the angrier I get"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "fac09a8f",
"en_raw": "Talking to me so casually"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "760239f3",
"en_raw": "...That salaryman?"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "f48fd062",
"en_raw": "Don't talk to me"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "250e49a1",
"en_raw": "I'm feeling really"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "23a1ab3e",
"en_raw": "down right now"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "47ec5843",
"en_raw": "...But I guess this explains"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "807b5720",
"en_raw": "the spirit's voice too"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "c373dc3b",
"en_raw": "No, you see, Nao"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "76f48f7c",
"en_raw": "She wants to go home?"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "61d6d197",
"en_raw": "You want to go home, Shiina?"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "dac8ce56",
"en_raw": "No, not that"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "e35fbd81",
"en_raw": "The woman there"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "059d1143",
"en_raw": "She wants to go home"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "2c882522",
"en_raw": "Ugh, enough for today!"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "97b51275",
"en_raw": "I'm never walking under there"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "dfed3972",
"en_raw": "Men are filthy, after all"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "0b5ebb11",
"en_raw": "Nao will surely"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "08f247b9",
"en_raw": "turn out like that too"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "3b95398e",
"en_raw": "This is ridiculous, geez..."
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "15423a4d",
"en_raw": "You see, the woman"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "d3704ff9",
"en_raw": "wants to go home..."
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "8f31c9e9",
"en_raw": "We've heard that many times"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "3a405570",
"en_raw": "What are you even talking about?"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "2b541a1d",
"en_raw": "The woman got home"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "4cc41486",
"en_raw": "But Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "20cecc02",
"en_raw": "doesn't like that place"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "1bd5c508",
"en_raw": "I agree with Shiina"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "1d994a93",
"en_raw": "It definitely feels unpleasant"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "0c941329",
"en_raw": "...The orange lights, too"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "6d89dc18",
"en_raw": "Listen, orange lights"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "13740dbf",
"en_raw": "are less affected by exhaust fumes"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "3a4e1b0c",
"en_raw": "so they're used in tunnels"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "abc75f9e",
"en_raw": "Fluorescent lights trouble cars"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "7dbbffef",
"en_raw": "so it's set up that way"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "124f9b31",
"en_raw": "People have really worked on it"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "909084a4",
"en_raw": "even a place like that"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "77e39359",
"en_raw": "...Are you still scared, Nao?"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "aba518e7",
"en_raw": "Sango, weren't you"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "22d642d6",
"en_raw": "scared at all?"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "6927e069",
"en_raw": "Well"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "e4abd63a",
"en_raw": "a weird person might show up"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "7a99f189",
"en_raw": "I wasn't scared so much as tense"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "017d824c",
"en_raw": "And Shiina walks so slowly"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "80b46173",
"en_raw": "...Well, we could investigate"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "6486c454",
"en_raw": "one more time, couldn't we?"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "64ee00cd",
"en_raw": "...Still, my shoulders"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "00631ac3",
"en_raw": "are oddly stiff. Why?"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "b9095ab7",
"en_raw": "Once you know the trick"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "cce2ef43",
"en_raw": "it's not worth being surprised"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "2521abbf",
"en_raw": "Am I saying"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "18d04792",
"en_raw": "anything wrong?"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "d17d761e",
"en_raw": "I don't know..."
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "43240012",
"en_raw": "We should go look again"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "52de5478",
"en_raw": "I suppose"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "857917d3",
"en_raw": "Whatever happens, I'll"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "c63a07cc",
"en_raw": "explain it for you"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "37577eef",
"en_raw": "The rumor of being stopped by a spirit"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "627d82b7",
"en_raw": "isn't heard anymore..."
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "8c3d6000",
"en_raw": "Because the traffic accident"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "48c4a81b",
"en_raw": "explained the trick, right?"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "b438d42a",
"en_raw": "So the rumor's solved"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "f17fc039",
"en_raw": "I think the ghost is a lie too"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "5005ebe5",
"en_raw": "But that bad feeling..."
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "2f5a1626",
"en_raw": "That's"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "c3664af6",
"en_raw": "...Listen, Nao"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "2dc1d087",
"en_raw": "All of that"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "fe530a05",
"en_raw": "just follows after the fact"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "4f863ddb",
"en_raw": "...Dim lights"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "291d02d5",
"en_raw": "a weird smell, weird people"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "c324b9d4",
"en_raw": "and then add a traffic accident"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "c7909d11",
"en_raw": "But everyone still says"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "2391f315",
"en_raw": "it's a scary place"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "06dddd4d",
"en_raw": "Which means, Nao"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "72eb2141",
"en_raw": "when it comes down to it"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "51560f11",
"en_raw": "you're enjoying it"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "d2f41d2f",
"en_raw": "...Aren't you?"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "be0d33ce",
"en_raw": "I think there's a bit of that"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "490f216e",
"en_raw": "But..."
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "7881099c",
"en_raw": "But what?"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "7e25fe00",
"en_raw": "...Never mind"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "ef5dbd97",
"en_raw": "Let's drop this"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "1dd23226",
"en_raw": "Just talking like this"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "9ca9768f",
"en_raw": "feels like we're"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "eea0167a",
"en_raw": "doing something wrong"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "24fec685",
"en_raw": "So you mean that in this world there's still"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "ba703631",
"en_raw": "a sense of something"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "a0ce97fa",
"en_raw": "unexplained and incomprehensible"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "43dc1948",
"en_raw": "is that it?"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "b8825531",
"en_raw": "...No"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "ab4bd15d",
"en_raw": "I just don't have"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "c1a25955",
"en_raw": "Sango's courage"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "025fd5e8",
"en_raw": "Either way"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "2b8cee5c",
"en_raw": "it doesn't affect my life"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "f9aace79",
"en_raw": "at all"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "6d7ed82b",
"en_raw": "Rumor of the Underpass Ghost"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "3db1ab3c",
"en_raw": "solved!"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "17037107",
"en_raw": "The rumor about a ghost under the tracks"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "df241b8c",
"en_raw": "isn't heard anymore"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "7bc4ad3e",
"en_raw": "Everyone got bored, I guess"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "2705d802",
"en_raw": "But that underpass still"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "66792d9c",
"en_raw": "gives me a bad feeling"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "59639004",
"en_raw": "That's just your imagination"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "5ad18916",
"en_raw": "Right, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "505fd31e",
"en_raw": "The woman in blue is still there"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "4f0cb336",
"en_raw": "She can't go home..."
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "6cc2d912",
"en_raw": "...What's that about?"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "776aa352",
"en_raw": "Hmm..."
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "d41e87aa",
"en_raw": "Dunno"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "4bdbf8fe",
"en_raw": "Well, whatever"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "a3cf7c2d",
"en_raw": "They make a fuss at the slightest thing"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "c4458b80",
"en_raw": "and it fades in three days"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "0d83bb0d",
"en_raw": "just like every rumor"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "6d7ed82b",
"en_raw": "Rumor of the Underpass Ghost"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "5dfcba3c",
"en_raw": "Solved...?"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "29d0026c",
"en_raw": "In the end, the underpass"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "cce08dee",
"en_raw": "remains a horror spot"
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "495cbf42",
"en_raw": "Everyone really likes"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "d5caa849",
"en_raw": "that kind of story"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "60c8d068",
"en_raw": "I'll leave it at that"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}